# BlockerGraph AI - Frontend Environment Configuration

# Production API Base URL (Required on Vercel)
# In local development: Leave blank or unset to use the built-in Vite dev proxy (http://localhost:5000/api)
# In production (e.g. Vercel): Set to your deployed backend API URL
# Supported formats:
#   https://blockergraph-api.onrender.com
#   https://blockergraph-api.onrender.com/api
VITE_API_URL=
